# GitHub's language statistics: the game's code is the Rust crate. The rest
# is pret's build tooling and game data (maps, scripts, text, music written
# in assembler syntax, assembled into bytes; no code), kept only to build
# the ROM.
tools/** linguist-vendored
include/** linguist-vendored
constants/** linguist-vendored
asm/** linguist-vendored
data/** linguist-vendored
sound/** linguist-vendored
Makefile linguist-vendored
*.mk linguist-vendored
*.ld linguist-vendored
build_tools.sh linguist-vendored
rust/assets/*.mk linguist-generated
